@baseUrl=http://localhost:8822

### With mismatch pathname
GET {{baseUrl}}/something HTTP/1.1


### Without a or b
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculate?b=11 HTTP/1.1

### With a or b as non-numeric
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculate?a=1&b=sad HTTP/1.1


### With correct params
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculate?a=22&b=21 HTTP/1.1


### Request data
GET {{baseUrl}}/data HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"Thomas"}

### 
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculator/add?a=110&b=2 HTTP/1.1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculator/subtract?a=7&b=2 HTTP/1.1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculator/multiply?a=1&b=2 HTTP/1.1

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculator/divide HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Author: Your-All-Mighty-Father

a=5&b=2